'' TKO0827, fbc's 349: a forward GOTO past a 'defer' whose scope holds the label. The
'' deferred statement runs at its scope's exit whether or not control passed it, so fbc
'' refuses the jump. tiko compiled all of these and ran the defer. See
'' symbols/resolvedefer.bas.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/defer-goto-errors.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: defer-goto-errors.bas(5,5): error TKO0827: the jump to 's1' crosses a 'defer'
'' EXPECT-OUT: defer-goto-errors.bas(11,5): error TKO0827
'' EXPECT-OUT: defer-goto-errors.bas(19,9): error TKO0827
'' EXPECT-OUT: defer-goto-errors.bas(25,15): error TKO0827
'' EXPECT-OUT: defer-goto-errors.bas(75,5): error TKO0827
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 6
